-- D1C2A #583 / suite #61: a legitimate P0 enrollment placement reached
-- academic-executor-owned app_private.d1_enrollment_place_lock_destination.
-- Its SECURITY DEFINER body calls the schema-owner lock helper
-- app_private.d1_lock_academic_path(uuid,uuid,uuid); PostgreSQL denied EXECUTE.
--
-- Frozen Effect25_16 deliberately REVOKED the old direct Student-executor
-- EXECUTE privilege and relocated academic locking to its fixed typed
-- schoolos_academic_executor helper. It did not install the corresponding
-- executor-to-executor edge. Restore ONLY the academic-executor -> schema
-- owner path-lock function EXECUTE edge; keep Student executor, authenticated,
-- anon and service_role denied. The trusted function still locks the ordered
-- Academic Class -> Campus -> Academic Year -> Class Offering -> Section.
-- No role inheritance, table privileges, RLS bypass or remote migration.
-- Append-only inactive Migration 10 continuation.
SET ROLE schoolos_schema_owner;
GRANT EXECUTE ON FUNCTION app_private.d1_lock_academic_path(uuid,uuid,uuid)
  TO schoolos_academic_executor;
RESET ROLE;
